        "original_id": "8a2d04f1-2b26-59cb-95cc-7c81a8de7677",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lupin Mine, Lost Lemon Mine, Lupin Airport, Nunavut, Alberta, Canada\n- Companies: Echo Bay Mines Limited\n- Topics: gold mines, legendary lost mines, airports\n\nFacts:\n- Lupin Mine was a gold mine in Nunavut Territory, Canada.\n- The Lost Lemon Mine is a legendary lost mine said to be located in Alberta, Canada.\n- Lupin Airport was an airport at Lupin Mine in Nunavut, Canada.\n- Echo Bay Mines Limited operated Lupin Airport.\n- Lupin Airport had the codes IATA YWO and ICAO CYWO.",
